%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
# SCENE SLICE — Cho Dau Moi (khu 2/18, slice dau tien). Khung C1/C2.
# Mo ta verbatim (docs/art-style.md §4 — dung nguyen van moi lan):
# "cho dau moi luc 5 gio sang, sap rau cu xep cao, la chuoi, thung xop, xe ba
#  gac, nguoi ganh hang, den vang, hoi suong".
# TRANG THAI: khung scene — CHUA CO ART. assets/ dang trong (dung trang thai).
# Art chi duoc dung placeholder CC0 ghi ro nguon (Kenney.nl, OpenGameArt tag CC0,
# Unity Top-Down Starter Kit) — khong asset lau / rip tu game khac.
# Camera khoa: orthographic, goc X ~30 / Y 45, ti le 9:16 (mobile doc).
# Sort axis khoa o ProjectSettings/GraphicsSettings.asset: (0, 1, -0.26).
# Unity mo lan dau se chuan hoa lai file nay (xoa comment YAML nay) — binh thuong.
# C2 (18/11): them GameManager (GameManagerBehaviour), Player (PlayerController),
# Hotspot hs-cho-sang + hs-cho-chieu (HotspotView), CameraFollowBehaviour tren
# Main Camera (tam — thay bang CinemachineBrain + VirtualCamera trong Editor,
# xem Scripts/README.md). hs-tro-toi o scene SliceXomTroCu.unity;
# hs-cong-vien (17) o scene SliceCongVienAnBinh.unity; hs-cho-dem (18) o scene
# SlicePhoDiBoChoDem.unity (them 18/11 — 4/4 scene slice da co khung).
